# Digest-bearing artifacts are stored byte-exact. Any end-of-line conversion would change
# their SHA-256 between platforms and break the reproducibility claims that cite it.
.gitattributes text eol=lf
results/artifacts/*.json -text
experiments/M074/DEVELOPMENT_PROBE_BANK.json -text
experiments/M074/DEVELOPMENT_DRYRUN.json -text
experiments/M074/SCIENTIFIC_PROTOCOL.json -text
experiments/M074/SCIENTIFIC_RESULT.json -text
experiments/M075/DEVELOPMENT_DRYRUN.json -text
experiments/M075/MODEL_DEVELOPMENT_PROTOCOL.json -text
experiments/M075/MODEL_DEVELOPMENT_RESULT.json -text

# Conventional digest-bearing experiment artifacts are protected by naming convention rather than
# only by individual path. This prevents later milestones from silently reintroducing the
# checkout-dependent hash defect already observed on Windows checkouts.
experiments/M0*/PROTOCOL.json -text
experiments/M0*/QUALIFICATION_POOL.json -text
# A superseded pool is digest-bearing evidence in exactly the way the live one is.
experiments/M0*/QUALIFICATION_POOL_SUPERSEDED_*.json -text
# A design audit and a checker report both carry their own digest and are compared
# against a fresh computation by their milestone's tests. M092 protected its copies by
# individual path; these two conventional names were left unguarded at M094.
experiments/M0*/DESIGN_AUDIT.json -text
experiments/M0*/CHECK_REPORT.json -text
experiments/M0*/RESULT.json -text
experiments/M0*/QUALIFICATION.json -text
experiments/M0*/BANK_COMMITMENT.json -text
experiments/M0*/EPISODE_COMMITMENT.json -text
experiments/M0*/SCHEDULE_COMMITMENT.json -text
experiments/M0*/*-image/Dockerfile -text

# Genesis II experiment artifacts and every source byte bound by M103 must be invariant across
# Windows and POSIX checkouts. The older M0* convention stopped matching at M100, which allowed
# M102's checker and two retained runtime sources to acquire checkout-specific CRLF bytes in the
# first M103 owner-review candidate. JSON evidence remains byte-exact; executable/text sources are
# canonical LF so isolated capsules have the same digest and behavior on every supported checkout.
experiments/M1*/*.json -text
experiments/M103/PRE_REGISTRATION.md text eol=lf
experiments/M103/ADVERSARIAL_REVIEW.md text eol=lf
experiments/M104/*.md text eol=lf
